@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Contact Us";
}

<div class="legal-page">
    <h1 class="legal-page__title">Contact Us</h1>

    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about our Service, need support, or wish to exercise your data protection rights (such as accessing, correcting, or deleting your personal data), please reach out to us.</p>

        <div class="contact-card">
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:tngo0508@gmail.com">tngo0508@gmail.com</a></p>
        </div>

        <p>We aim to respond to all inquiries within 2 business days. For data protection requests under GDPR, we will respond within 30 days as required by law.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Data Protection Requests</h2>
        <p>If you are submitting a data protection request (access, rectification, erasure, portability, objection, or restriction), please include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Your account email address</li>
            <li>A clear description of your request</li>
            <li>Any relevant details to help us locate your data</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We may ask for additional information to verify your identity before processing your request.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Reporting Security Issues</h2>
        <p>If you discover a security vulnerability, please report it to us immediately at <a href="mailto:tngo0508@gmail.com">tngo0508@gmail.com</a>. We take security seriously and will respond promptly.</p>
    </section>
</div>
